  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIVA - Sustainable Coastal Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIVA will provide technical support to the National Center for Coastal Researce to develop capacity in ocean accounting and sustainable use of ocean resources including coastal areas - a technical pilot will be on mangrove forests in Andhra Pradesh</narrative>
  </description>
